# Earthbender Ascension's reflexive trigger puts a +1/+1 counter on "target creature you control" (CR 603.12, 608.2b). With the fourth quest counter
# on turn 5 the trigger goes on the stack targeting the Ornithopter, and in response Bot2 kills the Ornithopter with Lightning Bolt: the only target is
# illegal, so the ability does not resolve and nobody gets a counter. The earthbent Forest keeps its two counters only. (The neighbouring
# scenario with four quest counters is the positive control.)

